    "detailed_description": "Control Musa, the musical disco note. Travel through various surreal environments and dance across the universe! See if you can move faster than your friends and achieve the highest BPM.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTempo is a single-player rhythm game that offers an audiovisual arcade experience to test your speed and accuracy. Speedrun high-intensity levels by mastering the tracks to top the global leaderboards. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSupport for:<br />\r\n-Mouse and Keyboard<br />\r\n-Controller",
